      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 16,
      "pattern": "^\\d{1,13}([.]\\d{2})?$",
      "description": "A dollar amount that cannot be negative, up to 9,999,999,999,999.99.\n\nOne digit wider than `MonetaryAmountMax12Digits`, for a total that has to hold the sum of\nfields constrained to that."
